title: Design + implement bounded polymorphism (traits/protocols)
status: complete
atomic: false
priority: high
blocked_by: []
created_at: '2026-06-04T04:27:12'
updated_at: '2026-06-04T04:56:41'
result: 'Completed bounded polymorphism (traits) P0 remediation.


  Gap fixed: DEFAULT TRAIT METHOD BODIES now dispatch. Implementation:

  - Added Typer.trait_defs (full ast::TraitDef storage) and trait_default_methods
  map keyed by (type_name, trait_name) in src/typer/mod.rs.

  - declare_trait_def now stores the full TraitDef.

  - declare_impl_block synthesizes ast::Fn methods from trait defaults the impl omits
  (new synthesize_default_methods + subst_self_ty helpers in src/typer/resolve.rs),
  registers them in self.methods and via declare_method_sig_by_ptr so they get fns/fn_schemes
  entries and method DefIds.

  - lower_impl_block (src/typer/lower/decl.rs) lowers the synthesized methods alongside
  explicit ones.


  Default methods can call other trait methods on self (e.g. self.name()), can be
  overridden by an explicit impl method, and dispatch through a generic trait bound.


  Conformance suite tests/traits.rs added (7 tests, all green): direct dispatch, generic
  dispatch through bound, bound enforcement diagnostic, multi-bound (T: A + B), default
  method body, default overridden by impl, default through bound.


  Verified: zero build + clippy warnings; full cargo test suite passes with no regressions
  (912 + 423 + 224 + others, 0 failures).'
description: 'ASSESSMENT (verified by compile tests 2026-06-04): trait system is ~80%
  done. WORKS: `trait X` / `impl X for T` parse to AST/HIR; direct method dispatch
  `p.display()` works; generic bounds `*f of T: Printable(t as T)` parse, are enforced
  (good call-site diagnostic: "type `Bare` does not satisfy trait bound `Printable`"),
  and monomorphized dispatch through a bound param works end-to-end. CONFIRMED GAPS
  to fix for P0: (1) DEFAULT TRAIT METHOD BODIES do not dispatch — a trait `*hello(self)
  <body>` default that an impl omits fails with "unknown method hello". Need: during
  impl lowering, synthesize missing methods from trait defaults (in src/typer/lower/decl.rs
  lower_impl_block + the fns pre-pass). (2) Add conformance suite tests/traits.rs
  pinning: direct dispatch, bound enforcement error, multi-bound (T: A + B), generic-through-bound
  dispatch, default methods, default method overridden by impl. (3) Verify multi-bound
  `+` syntax works. Idiomatic: keep `of T: Trait` and natural-language. Definition
  of done: default methods work; conformance suite added & green; zero build warnings.'
